        },
        {
          "text": "“Kopucin da ka apakio nueseunitai eraun ainakinet naka akiria epa ediopet kanuka emoŋ lotobait, ka epa ediopet kanuka emerekek, ido kwape epedoria ainakin kanuka imerekekin ludidik, ekin da loka akinyet kanoli epa. ",
