              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itemonokini da ainakinet naka akiria nepepe kaŋes, ŋinitupuruc, idiopet kokanykape yenika epa, ka idiopet kouni yenika ekin loka akinyet ainyalakinia kakiria nuidicic; ainakinet naka akiria natir mama ejai EJAKAIT kanuka aicorakinet namam enaŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaŋin itemonokinioto imerekek, ka ainakinet naka akiria, ka akinyet, ninitupuruc, araut ainakinet natir naicweio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        }
