        {
          "text": " Bobo da mam ekapolon eyaŋaari airumet naka ituŋa, aireŋear kalupokec; einakini odweke airumet naelemuni kalupoke elopet: kinyeis ikatuŋa aisiarisiarun ŋinituŋanan anyoun kalupoke.”",
