        {
          "text": " Katema eoŋ atiar, “Na ŋes aibois naipoenenoto isasedotin ainakinet naka adiakaret ka ainakinet naka aronis, neepeenenoto ainakinet naka akiria; tetere mam itolomarete alaro nakokina, aitalaunia ituŋa.”",
